 for strong or clearly turning momentum before treating the setup as corrected.', 'teaching_action': 'Do not repeat weak-momentum entries; wait until momentum confirms the same side.', 'title': 'Momentum Must Confirm'}, {'confirmation_required': ['structure_hold', 'clear_structure', 'not_mid_range'], 'failed_when': ['structure was unclear', 'structure did not hold', 'price was mid-range without a clean reaction'], 'id': 'structure_must_hold', 'lesson': 'Structure labels like HH/HL or LH/LL are not enough by themselves. Atlas needs evidence that structure is holding at the entry location before execution review.', 'teaching_action': 'Treat unclear structure as developing context, not execution permission.', 'title': 'Structure Must Hold'}, {'confirmation_required': ['failed_ingredient_corrected', 'current_setup_differs_from_loss_memory', 'normal_gates_still_pass'], 'failed_when': ['same pattern is repeated with the same missing evidence', 'loss memory is interpreted as a blanket ban', 'confidence is punished without a correction path'], 'id': 'loss_pattern_is_not_pattern_ban', 'lesson': 'A loss in a pattern does not mean Atlas must stop trading that pattern. It means Atlas must identify what failed and require a corrected version before trading it again.', 'teaching_action': 'Keep the pattern tradable, but require proof that the previous mistake is not being repeated.', 'title': 'Loss Pattern Is Not Pattern Ban'}, {'confirmation_required': ['manual_operator_review_for_unlock', 'risk_guard_clear', 'strategy_learning_explained_separately'], 'failed_when': ['risk protection is confused with pattern learning', 'operator assumes safety lock means strategy ban', 'Atlas explains safety as if it were setup logic'], 'id': 'safety_lock_is_separate_from_learning', 'lesson': 'The safety lock protects the account after weak performance. It is not a lesson that a setup family should never trade again.', 'teaching_action': 'Explain safety lock and pattern learning as separate lanes.', 'title': 'Safety Lock Is Separate From Learning'}], 'policy_note': 'These teachings are bounded knowledge and observability. They do not rewrite strategies, lower thresholds, alter risk, unlock safety, force entries, or bypass execution gates.', 'relevant': [{'confirmation_required': ['structure_hold', 'strong_m1_momentum', 'same_side_support'], 'failed_when': ['continuation was assumed before structure held', 'momentum was mixed or weak', 'same-side support was thin'], 'id': 'false_continuation_requires_confirmation', 'lesson': 'A continuation idea is not executable just because direction exists. Atlas must require structure to hold, strong or turning M1 momentum, and same-side support before trusting continuation again.', 'teaching_action': 'Trade the continuation pattern again only when the failed confirmation ingredient has changed.', 'title': 'False Continuation Requires Confirmation'}, {'confirmation_required': ['fresh_entry_location', 'retest_or_pullback', 'no_overextension'], 'failed_when': ['entry chased expansion', 'entry arrived before confirmation', 'entry was mid-range or stale'], 'id': 'timing_failure_needs_fresher_entry', 'lesson': 'When the idea was possibly valid but timing was early, late, or weak, Atlas should not discard the idea. It should wait for a fresher entry, retest, pullback, or cleaner trigger.', 'teaching_action': 'Separate idea quality from entry timing quality before applying a lesson.', 'title': 'Timing Failure Needs Fresher Entry'}, {'confirmation_required': ['strong_m1_momentum', 'momentum_alignment', 'directional_impulse'], 'failed_when': ['momentum was weak', 'momentum was mixed', 'price drifted without impulse'], 'id': 'momentum_must_confirm', 'lesson': 'Mixed M1 momentum is not enough for a continuation setup after recent losses. Atlas should wait for strong or clearly turning momentum before treating the setup as corrected.', 'teaching_action': 'Do not repeat weak-momentum entries; wait until momentum confirms the same sid